{"from": "passage:mk-08-10", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-15-39", "note": "Mark reads Dalmanutha; Matthew reads Magdala (variant Magadan); several Markan manuscripts themselves read Magdala/Mageda."}
{"from": "passage:mk-08-11", "type": "parallels", "to": "passage:mt-16-01", "note": "Mark names only Pharisees; Matthew names Pharisees and Sadducees. Difference recorded on the related_to edge between the claims."}
