{"from": "claim:mk-08-10-dalmanutha", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-15-39-borders-magdala", "note": "Mark reads Dalmanutha (otherwise unattested); Matthew reads Magdala (variant Magadan); several Markan manuscripts (Theta, f1, f13, 565) read Magdala/Mageda, so the two accounts may name the same shore."}
{"from": "claim:mk-08-11-sign-from-heaven", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-16-01-seek-sign", "note": "Mark names only Pharisees; Matthew names Pharisees and Sadducees."}
{"from": "claim:mk-08-12-no-sign-generation", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-16-04-sign-of-jonah", "note": "Mark gives no qualifying sign at all; Matthew adds 'except the sign of the prophet Jonah'."}
{"from": "claim:mk-08-14-one-loaf", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-16-05-forgot-bread", "note": "Mark adds the detail that they had no more than one loaf in the boat; Matthew records only the forgetting."}
{"from": "claim:mk-08-15-leaven-herod", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-16-06-leaven-warning", "note": "Mark pairs the Pharisees with Herod (Antipas); Matthew pairs them with the Sadducees."}
{"from": "claim:mk-08-28-identifications", "type": "related_to", "to": "claim:mt-16-14-popular-identifications", "note": "Mark lists John the Baptizer, Elijah and one of the prophets; Matthew adds Jeremiah."}
